d\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Starting the Key quest</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description_2\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Abandoned Mine is a Mine located near the Bridge for the <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>. This location is the starting point for the <a href=\"/wiki/Key\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Key\">Key</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertain_Pickaxe\" title=\"Uncertain Pickaxe\">Uncertain Pickaxe</a> quests. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Abandoned mine is a small room located inside of a cliff. Inside there are 3 pillars holding it from collapsing, as well as a blocked off trapdoor that as of date does not lead anywhere. Walls are decorated with unknown neon ores. To the left of the entrance a button is located with runes above it which can be translated to \"TRIGGER\". UI of the button itself states \"Registry\", while the interaction prompt states \"PRESS TRIGGER\". Pressing it activates the <a href=\"/wiki/Key\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Key\">Key</a> pedestals.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"5145d26db879fcb137abc71d230e4916\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:82px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Button-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:80px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Button.png\" title=\"Button.png (3.02 MB)\" style=\"height:80px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cf/Button.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230718130908\" title=\"Button.png (3.02 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"80\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Button.png\" data-image-key=\"Button.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Button.png (3.02 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"80\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Button.png\" data-image-key=\"Button.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cf/Button.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230718130908\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>For only a single patch, the trapdoor had a sign which read \"Laboratory\". Coincidentally, next update added the <a href=\"/wiki/Key\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Key\">Key</a> quest.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; backgroun